msgid "FastFlags"
msgstr "FastFlags"

msgid ""
"FastFlags are hidden Roblox settings you can change yourself. Only some of "
"them are meant to be changed, and what happens to an account that changes "
"the rest is Roblox's decision alone."
msgstr ""
"FastFlags son ajustes ocultos de Roblox que puedes cambiar. Solo algunos "
"están pensados para cambiarse, y lo que ocurra con una cuenta que cambie el "
"resto es decisión exclusiva de Roblox."

